        "original_id": "ebf4bc2a-1172-5319-ba4e-1c3d987d1cf9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Taylor Swift, Rihanna, Katy Perry, Bruno Mars, Ke$ha, The Black Eyed Peas, Usher\n- Songs: \"Style\", \"Blank Space\", \"Out of the Woods\"\n- Albums: \"1989\"\n- Companies: Republic Records, Big Machine Records\n- Radio/Media: Hits Now!\n- Topics: single releases, album track order, Top 40 (CHR) playlists\n\nFacts:\n- Taylor Swift released \"Blank Space\" on her 2014 fifth studio album \"1989\".\n- \"Style\" followed \"Blank Space\" as a single from Taylor Swift's album \"1989\".\n- Republic Records, in partnership with Big Machine Records, released Taylor Swift's song \"Style\" to radio on February 9, 2015, as the third single from \"1989\".\n- Taylor Swift's song \"Style\" appears before \"Out of the Woods\" on the track list of the album \"1989\", where \"Out of the Woods\" is the fourth track.\n- Hits Now! mainly targets listeners ages 18–49.\n- Hits Now! mostly plays Top 40 (CHR) music by artists including Rihanna, Katy Perry, Taylor Swift, Bruno Mars, Ke$ha, The Black Eyed Peas, and Usher.",
